# CLAUDE.md is Claude Code's project instructions, not site content, but
# render_site() renders every root-level .md and _site.yml's `exclude:` only
# filters copied resources, not rendered input. Ignoring the output keeps it
# off GitHub Pages: the scheduled refresh commits with `git add -A`, which
# respects this file.
CLAUDE.html
